<title>AUSTRALIA: Lend Lease completes Equitable deal.</title>
<headline>Lend Lease completes Equitable deal.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian property and financial services group Lend Lease Corp said on Wednesday it had completed the acquisition of Equitable Real Estate Investment Management Inc from United States fund manager Equitable Cos Inc.</p>
<p>In a deal first announced in April, Lend Lease paid US$300 million in cash and US$100 million in the form of an eight year note.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
